{
	"nodes":[
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60101","type":"text","text":"# Transformer 架构\n## Attention Is All You Need\n📌 Vaswani et al. 2017","x":-200,"y":-560,"width":320,"height":160,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60102","type":"text","text":"⚠️ RNN的局限性\n- 串行处理，无法并行\n- 长距离依赖衰减\n- 梯度消失/爆炸","x":-780,"y":-540,"width":260,"height":140},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60103","type":"text","text":"🌟 Transformer优势\n- 完全并行计算\n- 直接建模任意距离依赖\n- 可扩展性强(Scaling Law)\n- 统一架构：NLP/CV/多模态","x":440,"y":-540,"width":300,"height":180},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60202","type":"text","text":"🔑 多头注意力\nMulti-Head Attention","x":-140,"y":-220,"width":220,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60203","type":"text","text":"🔑 位置编码\nPositional Encoding","x":280,"y":-220,"width":220,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60306","type":"text","text":"正弦/余弦位置编码\n\n$$PE_{(pos,2i)} = \\sin\\left(\\frac{pos}{10000^{2i/d}}\\right)$$\n$$PE_{(pos,2i+1)} = \\cos\\left(\\frac{pos}{10000^{2i/d}}\\right)$$\n\n💡 优点：可外推到更长序列\n缺点：固定不可学习","x":280,"y":140,"width":360,"height":160},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60601","type":"text","text":"🔄 完整流程\n\nInput: \"I love NLP\"\n  ↓ Tokenize + Embedding\n  ↓ + Positional Encoding\n  ↓\nEncoder (×N)\n  ↓ K, V\n  ↓\nDecoder (×N) ← Output Embedding(shifted right)\n  ↓\nLinear + Softmax\n  ↓\nOutput: next token","x":-860,"y":1440,"width":380,"height":220,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60104","type":"text","text":"Transformer vs RNN\nRNN: h_t = f(x_t, h_{t-1})  串行\nTransformer: 所有token同时处理","x":-780,"y":-360,"width":300,"height":100},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60105","type":"text","text":"核心创新：用Attention替代RNN\nSelf-Attention → 每个词关联所有词\n并行 + 长距离 = 革命性突破","x":560,"y":-225,"width":300,"height":80},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60305","type":"text","text":"为什么需要位置编码？\n⚠️ Self-Attention 对位置\n完全不敏感！\n\"A loves B\" = \"B loves A\"\n→ 必须注入位置信息","x":300,"y":-55,"width":280,"height":110},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60307","type":"text","text":"可学习位置编码\nLearned Positional Embedding\n\n直接用 Embedding 层学习位置\nBERT/GPT 使用这种方式\n\n💡 更灵活，但不能外推","x":800,"y":115,"width":260,"height":130},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60401","type":"text","text":"FFN：Position-wise Feed Forward\n\n$$\\text{FFN}(x) = \\text{ReLU}(xW_1 + b_1)W_2 + b_2$$\n或使用 GELU / SwiGLU\n\n🌟 两层全连接：\nd_model → d_ff (4×扩展) → d_model\n每个位置独立处理，增加非线性","x":-960,"y":800,"width":380,"height":220},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60500","type":"text","text":"# ==========================================\n# Encoder & Decoder 架构\n# ==========================================","x":-990,"y":1060,"width":600,"height":60},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60501","type":"text","text":"🏗️ Encoder Layer\n\nInput → \n  ├─ Multi-Head Self-Attention\n  │   └─ Add & Norm\n  └─ Feed Forward Network\n      └─ Add & Norm\n→ Output\n\n💡 双向注意力：每个token看所有token","x":-1080,"y":1140,"width":340,"height":260,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60502","type":"text","text":"📚 Encoder 堆叠\nN = 6 层 Encoder Layer\n\nInput Embedding →\n  ┌─────────────────┐\n  │ Encoder × N     │\n  │ 各层独立参数     │\n  └─────────────────┘\n→ K, V (给Decoder用)","x":-620,"y":1140,"width":280,"height":240,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60503","type":"text","text":"Decoder Layer 结构差异\n\nInput → \n  ├─ Masked Self-Attention  ← 单向！\n  │   └─ Add & Norm\n  ├─ Cross-Attention        ← 新增！\n  │   Q=Decoder, K,V=Encoder\n  │   └─ Add & Norm\n  └─ Feed Forward Network\n      └─ Add & Norm\n→ Output","x":-80,"y":1110,"width":360,"height":300,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60505","type":"text","text":"🔗 Cross-Attention\n(Encoder-Decoder Attention)\n\nQ → 来自 Decoder 上层输出\nK,V → 来自 Encoder 最终输出\n\nAttention(Q_dec, K_enc, V_enc)\n\n🌟 Decoder 在生成时'查阅'源信息\n类似翻译中参考原文","x":520,"y":1120,"width":320,"height":250},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60506","type":"text","text":"📚 Decoder 也堆叠 N=6 层\n\n训练：Teacher Forcing\n→ 用真实target作输入\n\n推理：自回归生成\n→ 一步一步生成，\n每次用已生成的token作输入","x":1100,"y":1135,"width":260,"height":220,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60602","type":"text","text":"训练与推理对比\n\n📌 训练 (Teacher Forcing):\n输入: <sos> I love NLP\n目标: I love NLP <eos>\n→ 一次并行计算所有位置损失\n\n📌 推理 (Autoregressive):\nStep 1: <sos> → I\nStep 2: <sos> I → love\nStep 3: <sos> I love → NLP\n→ 逐token串行生成","x":-440,"y":1535,"width":380,"height":330},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60504","type":"text","text":"🎭 Masked Self-Attention\n\n训练时：遮住未来token\n\nToken:   I   love   NLP\nI        ✓    ✗     ✗\nlove     ✓    ✓     ✗\nNLP      ✓    ✓     ✓\n\n💡 保证自回归生成时\n不会'偷看'答案","x":840,"y":1470,"width":280,"height":270},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60603","type":"text","text":"⚡ 核心超参数\n\n- d_model = 512  (隐藏维度)\n- d_k = d_v = 64 (每头维度)\n- h = 8  (注意力头数)\n- d_ff = 2048  (FFN中间层)\n- N = 6  (Encoder/Decoder层数)\n- Dropout = 0.1\n- Optimizer: Adam (β1=0.9, β2=0.98)\n- Warmup + Noam 学习率调度","x":50,"y":1605,"width":300,"height":310},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60704","type":"text","text":"🟣 Vision Transformer (ViT)\n\n- 图片分成 16×16 patches\n- 每个patch当做一个'token'\n- 标准 Transformer Encoder\n- 📌 证明了 Transformer 的通用性\n\n其他变体：\n- Swin Transformer (层次化)\n- DETR (目标检测)\n- CLIP (图文多模态)","x":410,"y":2000,"width":320,"height":305},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60701","type":"text","text":"🔵 BERT\nBidirectional Encoder\nRepresentations from Transformers\n\n- 仅 Encoder 结构\n- MLM: 随机遮住词预测\n- NSP: 判断两句是否连续\n- 📌 双向理解，适合 NLU 任务\n\n例：情感分析、命名实体识别、QA","x":-1000,"y":2000,"width":320,"height":265,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60702","type":"text","text":"🟢 GPT\nGenerative Pre-trained Transformer\n\n- 仅 Decoder 结构\n- 自回归语言模型\n- next token prediction\n- 📌 单向生成，适合 NLG 任务\n\nGPT-1 → GPT-2 → GPT-3 → GPT-4\nScaling Law: 大力出奇迹","x":-550,"y":2000,"width":320,"height":265,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60703","type":"text","text":"🟡 T5\nText-to-Text Transfer Transformer\n\n- 完整 Encoder-Decoder\n- 统一框架：一切任务 = text→text\n  \"translate: I love NLP\" → \"我爱NLP\"\n  \"summarize: ...\" → \"摘要内容\"\n- 📌 灵活性最强\n\n💡 用前缀控制任务类型","x":-90,"y":2000,"width":310,"height":305,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60800","type":"text","text":"💡 总结：Transformer 为什么成功？\n\n1. 并行计算 — GPU/TPU 友好，训练快\n2. 长距离依赖 — 直接路径，不看距离\n3. 统一架构 — Encoder/Decoder 灵活组合\n4. 可扩展 — 增大模型/数据持续提升 (Scaling Law)\n5. 通用性 — NLP → CV → 语音 → 多模态","x":-460,"y":2425,"width":500,"height":200,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60700","type":"text","text":"# ==========================================\n# Transformer 家族：预训练范式\n# ==========================================","x":-910,"y":1915,"width":600,"height":60},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60402","type":"text","text":"Layer Normalization\n\n对每个样本的特征维度做归一化\nμ = mean(x), σ = std(x)\n\n$$\\text{LayerNorm}(x) = \\gamma \\cdot \\frac{x - \\mu}{\\sigma} + \\beta$$\n\n💡 与Batch Norm区别：\nBN在batch维度 → 依赖batch size\nLN在feature维度 → 独立于batch","x":50,"y":780,"width":320,"height":260},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60204","type":"text","text":"🔑 前馈网络\nFeed Forward Network","x":-550,"y":530,"width":220,"height":110,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60205","type":"text","text":"🔑 残差连接 + 层归一化\nAdd & Norm","x":-110,"y":640,"width":240,"height":90,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60403","type":"text","text":"Residual Connection 残差连接\n\nx_out = LayerNorm(x + Sublayer(x))\n\nPost-LN (原论文): Sublayer 后 LN\nPre-LN (现代做法): Sublayer 前 LN\n\n🌟 作用：\n- 缓解梯度消失\n- 让深层网络更容易训练\n- 保留原始信息","x":530,"y":750,"width":300,"height":320},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60201","type":"text","text":"🔑 自注意力机制\nSelf-Attention","x":-790,"y":-220,"width":220,"height":70,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60301","type":"text","text":"Q, K, V 从哪来？\nX @ W_Q → Query（查询）\nX @ W_K → Key（键）\nX @ W_V → Value（值）\n\n💡 Q·K = 相关性得分\nV = 实际信息内容","x":-1240,"y":0,"width":280,"height":220},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60302","type":"text","text":"Scaled Dot-Product Attention\n1. Q @ K^T → 得分矩阵\n2. 除以 √d_k → 防止softmax饱和\n3. softmax → 权重归一化\n4. @ V → 加权求和输出\n\n💡 d_k = Key的维度","x":-850,"y":20,"width":300,"height":180},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60304","type":"text","text":"Multi-Head Attention\nh个头并行计算Attention：\n\nhead_i = Attention(Q_i, K_i, V_i)\n\nMultiHead = Concat(head_1,...,head_h) @ W_O\n\n🌟 不同头关注不同关系：\n语法/语义/位置/共指...","x":-290,"y":-40,"width":300,"height":260},
		{"id":"a1b2c3d4e5f60303","type":"text","text":"$$\\text{Attention}(Q,K,V) = \\text{softmax}\\left(\\frac{QK^T}{\\sqrt{d_k}}\\right)V$$","x":-910,"y":340,"width":420,"height":100}
	],
	"edges":[
		{"id":"e1b2c3d4e5f60101","fromNode":"a1b2c3d4e5f60102","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a1b2c3d4e5f60101","toSide":"left","label":"问题"},
		{"id":"e1b2c3d4e5f60102","fromNode":"a1b2c3d4e5f60101","fromSide":"right","toNode":"a1b2c3d4e5f60103","toSide":"left","label":"优势"},
